"width:0px\"></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500\">Current Stage</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-semibold text-[#0B4EA2]\">Steel Erection</p></div></div></div></a></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"bg-white py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-16 px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-80px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl shadow-2xl\"><img alt=\"MBS Construction\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"700\" height=\"700\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-[600px] w-full object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fabout-main.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fabout-main.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fabout-main.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-8 -right-8 hidden overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border-4 border-white bg-white shadow-2xl lg:block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><img alt=\"Completed Industrial Building\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"240\" height=\"180\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-44 w-60 object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fabout-overlay.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fabout-overlay.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fabout-overlay.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0B4EA2] px-6 py-5 text-white shadow-xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.8)\"><h3 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\">10+</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider\">Years Experience</p></div><div class=\"absolute -left-10 -bottom-10 -z-10 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-blue-200 blur-3xl opacity-40\"></div></div><div class=\"max-w-xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(80px)\"><span class=\"inline-block rounded-full bg-[#0B4EA2]/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#D62828]\">About MBS Construction</span><h2 class=\"mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-[#D62828] lg:text-5xl\">Building Stronger<span class=\"block\">Industrial Infrastructure</span></h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-[#0B4EA2]\">MBS Construction is a trusted construction company specializing in<strong> Pre-Engineered Buildings (PEB)</strong>, warehouse construction, civil construction, roofing solutions, and steel fabrication.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-[#0B4EA2]\">We deliver durable, innovative, and cost-effective industrial infrastructure with a strong commitment to quality, safety, and on-time project completion across Karnataka.</p><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:border-[#0B4EA2] hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0B4EA2]/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-6 w-6 text-[#0B4EA2]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-semibold text-[#0B4EA2]\">100+ Successfully Completed Projects</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:border-[#0B4EA2] hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0B4EA2]/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-6 w-6 text-[#0B4EA2]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-semibold text-[#0B4EA2]\">Pre-Engineered Building Specialists</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:border-[#0B4EA2] hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0B4EA2]/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-6 w-6 text-[#0B4EA2]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-semibold text-[#0B4EA2]\">Complete Civil Construction Solutions</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:border-[#0B4EA2] hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0B4EA2]/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-6 w-6 text-[#0B4EA2]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-semibold text-[#0B4EA2]\">Premium Roofing &amp; Steel Fabrication</p></div></div><a class=\"mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-[#D62828] px-7 py-4 font-semibold text-white transition duration-300 hover:bg-[#b71f1f]\" href=\"/about\">Know More About Us<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-slate-50 py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-16 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(25px)\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#0B4EA2]\">OUR PURPOSE</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-5xl font-bold text-[#D62828]\">Mission &amp; Vision</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#0B4EA2]\">We are committed to delivering exceptional industrial construction solutions while building long-lasting relationships based on trust, innovation, and engineering excellence.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-white p-10 shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-2xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-red-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target text-[#D62828]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-[#D62828]\">Our Mission</h3><p class=\"text-lg leading-9 text-[#0B4EA2]\">To deliver premium industrial construction, Pre-Engineered Buildings (PEB), warehouse construction, roofing systems, civil construction, and steel fabrication with uncompromising quality, innovative engineering, timely execution, and complete customer satisfaction.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-white p-10 shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-2xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(40px)\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye text-[#0B4EA2]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-[#D62828]\">Our Vision</h3><p class=\"text-lg leading-9 text-[#0B4EA2]\">To become Karnataka&#x27;s most trusted industrial construction company by delivering sustainable, innovative, and high-quality infrastructure that empowers industries, strengthens communities, and sets new benchmarks for engineering excellence.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"services\" class=\"bg-slate-50 py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-16 max-w-3xl text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><span class=\"rounded-full bg-[#D62828]/10 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D62828]\">Our Services</span><h2 class=\"mt-6 text-5xl font-bold text-[#D62828]\">Complete Construction Solutions</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-[#0B4EA2]\">MBS Construction delivers end-to-end industrial construction solutions including Pre-Engineered Buildings, Warehouses, Civil Construction, Roofing Systems, Steel Fabrication and Turnkey Projects across Karnataka.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"group overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-lg transition hover:shadow-2xl\"><div class=\"relative h-64 overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Pre Engineered Buildings\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fservices%2Fpeb.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fservices%2Fpeb.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fservices%2Fpeb.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fservices%2Fpeb.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fservices%2Fpeb.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fservices%2Fpeb.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fservices%2Fpeb.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fservices%2Fpeb.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fservices%2Fpeb.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-black/20 to-transparent\"></div><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 rounded-full bg-[#D62828] px-4 py-2 text-lg font-bold text-white\">01</span></div><div class=\"p-7\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#D62828]\">Pre Engineered Buildings</h3><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-[#0B4EA2]\">Complete PEB solutions for factories, warehouses, industrial sheds and commercial buildings.</p><a class=\"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#D62828] transition group-hover:gap-3\" href=\"/services/pre-engineered-buildings\">Learn More<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"group overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-lg transition hover:shadow-2xl\"><div class=\"relative h-64 overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Warehouse Construction\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"position:absol